// Go workspace tying the independently-deployable services (ADR-008) together
// for local development, so `shared` code can be edited and used by both
// services without publishing it anywhere. Each service still has its own
// go.mod and builds into its own independent binary/image — this file only
// affects the local dev toolchain, it has no effect on production builds.
//
// NOTE for whoever runs `go work init` for real: the Go version below is a
// conservative placeholder. Run `go version` after installing Go and bump
// every go.mod + this directive to match the actual installed toolchain
// rather than trusting this number — see backend/PLAN.md step 1.
go 1.23

use (
	./shared
	./services/gateway
	./services/auth
)
